---
import { ArrowRight, SlidersHorizontal } from '@lucide/astro';
import type { Corpus } from '../../lib/corpus';
interface Props { corpus: Corpus; }
const {corpus}=Astro.props;
---
<div class="template-columns"><section class="template-surface template-pad"><div class="template-section-head"><h2>What are you working through?</h2><span class="template-pill">Existing local tools</span></div><p class="template-muted">Open a task to understand what the worksheet does before entering anything. Results organize your questions; they do not decide coverage.</p>{corpus.liveTools.map(tool=><details class="template-disclosure tool-choice"><summary><SlidersHorizontal size={18} aria-hidden="true"/><span>{tool.data.name}</span></summary><p>{tool.data.summary}</p><div class="template-actions"><a class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" href={`/tools/${tool.id}`}>Open worksheet <ArrowRight size={15} aria-hidden="true"/></a><span class="template-meta">{tool.data.sourceIds.length} source records</span></div></details>)}</section><aside class="template-context"><section><h2>A worksheet, not a verdict.</h2><p>Each existing tool carries its own instructions, limits, and citations. A comparison can reveal missing details without telling you what an insurer will cover.</p></section><section><h2>Keep sensitive details out.</h2><p>Do not add names, policy numbers, claim identifiers, health information, or private documents. This launcher does not upload or process a policy.</p><a class="template-context-link" href="/design/templates/your-coverage">Preview the private coverage concept</a></section><section><h2>Need the underlying explanation?</h2><a class="template-context-link" href="/design/templates/topic">Browse coverage questions <ArrowRight size={15} aria-hidden="true"/></a><a class="template-context-link" href="/tools">Open the full tool directory</a></section></aside></div>
<style>.tool-choice { padding-bottom:16px; }.tool-choice summary { display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;list-style:none; }.tool-choice summary::after { content:'+';margin-left:auto;color:var(--muted); }.tool-choice[open] summary::after { content:'−'; }.tool-choice summary svg { flex-shrink:0;color:var(--brand-blue-text); }.tool-choice .template-actions { margin-top:16px; }</style>
